**Strategic Infrastructure Transition:**
We are implementing the Ghost CMS infrastructure to manage our sovereign global communications network. This deployment formally transitions our digital blueprint from a restricted "Press Access Only" pipeline into an open, high-velocity "Global B2C Publisher Hub." 

